# Eval of an RPM checkpoint trained with train_amass_p1_{reactive,smooth}.args
# under VR_Pose_Pred's AMASS protocol: every real frame scored (skip 0) after a
# static left pad that covers the rollout's whole GT seed (auto: 10 context
# frames + the first W-frame anchor), so the only GT the model sees is the held
# first-frame pose. Report mpjre_body (21 body joints = VR_Pose_Pred's mpjre),
# mpjpe, mpjve, pred_jitter / 100 and handpe; gt_jitter must read 400.61.
#   python test.py --model_path ./results/amass_p1_ours/checkpoints/<reactive|smooth>/model_latest.pt @config/amass_ours/eval_amass_p1.args
--eval
--eval_batch_size 16
--dataset amass_p1
--data_source vr_pose_pred
--dataset_path ./datasets_processed_ours/
--results_dir ./results/amass_p1_ours
--eval_left_pad -1
--eval_skip_frames 0
